  - m_Id: 6481381023334400
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i {0} l\u1EA7n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985847681024
    m_Localized: "Yo~ L\xEDnh m\u1EDBi! Ta l\xE0 Kata, thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng
      d\xE0y d\u1EA1n nh\u1EA5t v\xF9ng bi\u1EC3n n\xE0y. S\u1EB5n s\xE0ng gi\u01B0\u01A1ng
      bu\u1ED3m t\u1EDBi Th\xE1p \xC1c V\u01B0\u01A1ng ch\u01B0a n\xE0o?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041152
    m_Localized: "(N\u1EBFu skip nhanh) Kh\u1EDFi h\xE0nh th\xF4i, kh\xF4ng c\xF3
      th\u1EDDi gian l\u1EC1 m\u1EC1 \u0111\xE2u nh\xF3c!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041153
    m_Localized: "Th\u1EA5y ch\u01B0a? Th\u1EE7y th\u1EE7 c\u1EE7a nh\xF3c t\u1EF1
      x\xF4ng tr\u1EADn lu\xF4n \u0111\xF3. Vi\u1EC7c c\u1EE7a nh\xF3c l\xE0 c\u1EA7m
      l\xE1i, kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i khua ki\u1EBFm!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041154
    m_Localized: "C\u1EE9 \u0111\u1EC3 t\u1EE5i n\xF3 l\xE0m n\xF3ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc \u0111\xE3~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041155
    m_Localized: "Nh\u1EA5n v\xF4 \u0111\xE2y \u0111\u1EC3 ch\u1ECDn ai s\u1EBD ra
      tr\u1EADn l\xE0m ch\u1EE7 l\u1EF1c n\xE8! M\u1ED9t thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng
      gi\u1ECFi ph\u1EA3i bi\u1EBFt ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xFAng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041156
    m_Localized: "B\xED k\xEDp gia truy\u1EC1n n\xE8! Ch\u1EA1m sang anh h\xF9ng
      kh\xE1c \u0111\u1EC3 HO\xC1N \u0110\u1ED4I v\xE0 n\u1ED5 chi\xEAu c\u1EF1c
      m\u1EA1nh. Qu\u1EA9y l\xEAn n\xE0o!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041157
    m_Localized: "B\u1EADn tay h\u1EA3 nh\xF3c? B\u1EADt T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1ED9ng \u0110\xE1nh
      \u0111i, th\u1EE7y th\u1EE7 c\u1EE7a nh\xF3c t\u1EF1 c\xE0y k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3
      khi nh\xF3c \u0111i pha c\u1ED1c tr\xE0~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041158
    m_Localized: "L\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1ED9t ch\xFAt c\u0169ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c,
      mi\u1EC5n l\xE0 kho b\xE1u v\u1EABn \u0111\u1EA7y t\xFAi!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041159
    m_Localized: "M\u1EDF lu\xF4n T\u1EF1 \u0110\u1ED9ng Ultimate n\xE8! Chi\xEAu
      t\u1ED1i th\u01B0\u1EE3ng t\u1EF1 n\u1ED5 \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc, kh\u1ECFi canh
      me cho m\u1ECFi m\u1EAFt."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041160
    m_Localized: "La b\xE0n ch\u1EC9 h\u01B0\u1EDBng n\xE8! L\xE0m nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5
      \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn th\u01B0\u1EDFng \u0111\xE2y l\xE0 c\xE1ch nhanh nh\u1EA5t
      \u0111\u1EC3 bi\u1EBFt ph\u1EA3i \u0111i \u0111\xE2u ti\u1EBFp theo."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041161
    m_Localized: "Theo nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 l\xE0 kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD l\u1EA1c gi\u1EEFa
      bi\u1EC3n kh\u01A1i \u0111\xE2u nh\xF3c!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985877041162
    m_Localized: "Xong r\u1ED3i \u0111\xF3! H\u1ED1t th\u01B0\u1EDFng v\u1EC1 th\xF4i
      chi\u1EBFn l\u1EE3i ph\u1EA9m kh\xF4ng t\u1EF1 nh\u1EA3y v\xE0o t\xFAi \u0111\xE2u,
      ph\u1EA3i v\u01B0\u01A1n tay ra l\u1EA5y ch\u1EE9!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235456
    m_Localized: "Qu\xE0 ngon \u0111\u1EA5y, c\u1EA5t k\u1EF9 v\xE0o khoang t\xE0u
      nha~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235457
    m_Localized: "T\u1EDBi l\xFAc tuy\u1EC3n th\u1EE7y th\u1EE7 \u0111o\xE0n r\u1ED3i!
      Ti\u1EBFn v\xE0o khu tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EC3 chi\xEAu m\u1ED9 anh
      h\xF9ng m\u1EDBi n\xE0o."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235458
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1ED9i c\xE0ng \u0111\xF4ng, t\xE0u c\xE0ng m\u1EA1nh \u0111i
      n\xE0o nh\xF3c!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235459
    m_Localized: "Ch\u1ECDn lo\u1EA1i anh h\xF9ng nh\xF3c kho\xE1i r\u1ED3i tri\u1EC7u
      h\u1ED3i th\xF4i! V\u1EADn may c\u1EE7a d\xE2n bi\u1EC3n, bi\u1EBFt \u0111\xE2u
      v\u1EDB ngay h\xE0ng hi\u1EBFm~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235460
    m_Localized: "N\xE0o n\xE0o, th\u1EED v\u1EADn \u0111i s\xF3ng l\u1EDBn m\u1EDBi
      c\xF3 c\xE1 to!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235461
    m_Localized: "WOA! Nh\xECn xem ta v\u1EDB \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c ai n\xE8! M\u1ED9t
      chi\u1EBFn binh x\u1ECBn s\xF2 cho th\u1EE7y th\u1EE7 \u0111o\xE0n s\u1ED1
      nh\xF3c \u0111\u1ECF gh\xEA \u0111\xF3!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235462
    m_Localized: "H\xE0ng hi\u1EBFm \u0111\xE2y r\u1ED3i, \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3
      l\u1ECDt m\u1EA5t nha!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235463
    m_Localized: "C\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi m\u1EDBi r\u1ED3i th\xEC ph\u1EA3i x\u1EBFp
      ch\u1ED7 tr\xEAn t\xE0u ch\u1EE9! Ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o khu nh\xE2n v\u1EADt \u0111\u1EC3
      s\u1EAFp \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh n\xE0o."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235464
    m_Localized: "S\u1EAFp \u0111\u1ED9i ngay ng\u1EAFn th\xEC ra kh\u01A1i m\u1EDBi
      ngon~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235465
    m_Localized: "Cho l\xEDnh m\u1EDBi v\xE0o \u0111\u1ED9i h\xECnh n\xE0o! K\xE9o
      c\u1EADu ta v\xE0o \xF4 tr\u1ED1ng ch\u1ED7 n\xE0o tr\u1ED1ng th\xEC l\u1EA5p
      cho \u0111\u1EA7y."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235466
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1ED9i \u0111\u1EE7 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh
      t\u0103ng v\xF9 v\xF9 cho coi!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235467
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1ED9i h\xECnh chu\u1EA9n ch\u1EC9nh r\u1ED3i \u0111\xF3
      thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\xED! V\xE0o s\xE2u h\u01A1n \u0111\u1EC3 th\u1EED
      s\u1EE9c \u0111\u1ED9i m\u1EDBi t\u1EA7ng 2 \u0111ang ch\u1EDD!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235468
    m_Localized: "Gi\u01B0\u01A1ng bu\u1ED3m, ti\u1EBFn l\xEAn kho b\xE1u \u1EDF
      ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235469
    m_Localized: "Mu\u1ED1n m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n n\u1EEFa h\u1EA3? V\xE0o \u0111\xE2y
      n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 cho c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1ED9i t\xE0u t\u1ED1t
      ph\u1EA3i lo b\u1EA3o d\u01B0\u1EE1ng th\u01B0\u1EDDng xuy\xEAn!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235470
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1EA7u t\u01B0 v\xE0o s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD
      l\u1ED7 \u0111\xE2u nh\xF3c~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235471
    m_Localized: "Ch\u1ECDn ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 nh\xF3c mu\u1ED1n buff r\u1ED3i nh\u1EA5n
      n\xE2ng c\u1EA5p! T\u1EA5n c\xF4ng, m\xE1u, g\xEC c\u0169ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      t\xF9y nh\xF3c th\xEDch \u0111\xE1nh ki\u1EC3u n\xE0o."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235472
    m_Localized: "B\u01A1m th\xEAm ch\xFAt s\u1EE9c n\u1EEFa, m\u1EA1nh l\xE0 kh\xF4ng
      bao gi\u1EDD th\u1EEBa!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235473
    m_Localized: "Xong vi\u1EC7c b\u1EA3o d\u01B0\u1EE1ng r\u1ED3i, ra l\u1EA1i boong
      t\xE0u th\xF4i! Nh\u1EA5n tho\xE1t \u0111\u1EC3 quay l\u1EA1i chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng
      n\xE0o."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235474
    m_Localized: "M\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n r\u1ED3i \u0111\xF3, gi\u1EDD \u0111i khoe s\u1EE9c
      v\u1EDBi l\u0169 qu\xE1i!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985881235475
    m_Localized: "Th\u1EA5y kh\xE1c bi\u1EC7t ch\u01B0a? \u0110\u1ED9i c\u1EE7a nh\xF3c
      gi\u1EDD \u0111\xE1nh \u0111\xE2u th\u1EAFng \u0111\xF3 \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 th\xE0nh
      qu\u1EA3 c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng ch\u1ECBu kh\xF3!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429760
    m_Localized: "C\u1EE9 \u0111\xE0 n\xE0y th\xEC \u0111\u1EC9nh th\xE1p g\u1EA7n
      l\u1EAFm r\u1ED3i~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429761
    m_Localized: "Anh h\xF9ng gi\u1ECFi c\u1EA7n v\u0169 kh\xED x\u1ECBn! Ti\u1EBFn
      v\xE0o khu tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i v\u0169 kh\xED kho v\u0169 kh\xED c\u1EE7a ta
      s\u1EAFp \u0111\u1EA7y \u1EAFp \u0111\xE2y."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429762
    m_Localized: "Tay kh\xF4ng th\xEC \u0111\xE1nh sao l\u1EA1i qu\xE1i b\u1EF1,
      \u0111i s\u1EAFm \u0111\u1ED3 th\xF4i!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429763
    m_Localized: "Ch\u1ECDn lo\u1EA1i v\u0169 kh\xED r\u1ED3i tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i
      n\xE0o! Ki\u1EBFm, s\xFAng, g\u1EADy ph\xE9p m\xF3n n\xE0o c\u0169ng c\xF3,
      h\u1EE3p tay l\xE0 chi\u1EBFn!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429764
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u th\xEAm v\xE0i m\xF3n cho \u0111\xE3, \u0111\u1ED3 t\u1ED1t
      kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD th\u1EEBa~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429765
    m_Localized: "Nh\xECn m\xF3n n\xE0y coi! S\u1EAFc l\u1EBBm lu\xF4n trang b\u1ECB
      ngay cho anh h\xF9ng c\u1EE7a nh\xF3c l\xE0 b\xE1 \u0111\u1EA1o li\u1EC1n!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429766
    m_Localized: "V\u0169 kh\xED ngon th\u1EBF n\xE0y m\xE0 kh\xF4ng x\xE0i th\xEC
      ph\xED c\u1EE7a gi\u1EDDi~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429767
    m_Localized: "C\xF3 \u0111\u1ED3 r\u1ED3i th\xEC ph\u1EA3i l\u1EAFp v\xE0o ch\u1EE9
      \u0111\u1EC3 ng\u1EAFm \xE0? Ch\u1EA1m khu trang b\u1ECB \u0111\u1EC3 g\u1EAFn
      v\u0169 kh\xED cho \u0111\u1ED9i n\xE0o."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429768
    m_Localized: "L\u1EAFp \u0111\u1ED3 v\xE0o, s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh nh\xE2n \u0111\xF4i
      cho coi!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429769
    m_Localized: "Ch\u1ECDn \xF4 v\u0169 kh\xED nh\xF3c mu\u1ED1n l\u1EAFp n\xE8!
      M\u1ED7i anh h\xF9ng m\u1ED9t m\xF3n h\u1EE3p tay, l\u1EF1a cho kh\xE9o nha."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429770
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3 v\u0169 kh\xED x\u1ECBn n\u1EB1m kh\xF4ng
      trong khoang t\xE0u~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429771
    m_Localized: "\u0110\xE2y l\xE0 kho \u0111\u1ED3 c\u1EE7a nh\xF3c ch\u1ECDn m\xF3n
      ngon nh\u1EA5t m\xE0 g\u1EAFn v\xE0o! Ch\u1EC9 s\u1ED1 s\u1EBD nh\u1EA3y v\u1ECDt
      cho coi."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429772
    m_Localized: "L\u1EF1a k\u1EF9 nha, v\u0169 kh\xED t\u1ED1t quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh
      c\u1EA3 tr\u1EADn \u0111\xE1nh \u0111\xF3!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429773
    m_Localized: "Trang b\u1ECB xong, s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh \u0111\u1EA7y m\xECnh r\u1ED3i
      \u0111\xF3 thuy\u1EC1n tr\u01B0\u1EDFng nh\xED! Ta d\u1EA1y h\u1EBFt r\u1ED3i
      \u0111\u1EA5y gi\u1EDD t\u1EF1 do tung ho\xE0nh n\xE0o!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429774
    m_Localized: "Bi\u1EC3n l\u1EDBn \u0111ang ch\u1EDD, c\u1EE9 g\u1ECDi ta n\u1EBFu
      c\u1EA7n. Gi\u01B0\u01A1ng bu\u1ED3m th\xF4iii~"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429775
    m_Localized: "Th\xE1nh Ki\u1EBFm Xuy\xEAn K\xEDch"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429776
    m_Localized: "Th\u1EA7n Ki\u1EBFm Thi\xEAn Gi\xE1ng"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429777
    m_Localized: "\u1EA2nh B\u1ED9"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429778
    m_Localized: "Ki\u1EBFm Nh\u1EADn L\u1ED1c Xo\xE1y"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429779
    m_Localized: "Huy\u1EC5n \u1EA2nh \u0110\u1EA1i Tr\u1EA3m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429780
    m_Localized: "Ki\u1EBFm B\xE3o Lu\xE2n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429781
    m_Localized: "D\u1EA5u \u1EA4n T\u1EED Vong"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429782
    m_Localized: "\u1EA2nh B\u1ED9c Tr\u1EA3m"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429783
    m_Localized: "\u1EA2nh Tr\u1EA3m K\u1EBFt Gi\u1EDBi"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429784
    m_Localized: "Thi\xEAn \u1EA2nh L\u0129nh V\u1EF1c"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429785
    m_Localized: "Th\xE1nh Ti\u1EC5n Galtin"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429786
    m_Localized: "L\xF4i Long"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429787
    m_Localized: "Ph\u01B0\u1EE3ng Ho\xE0ng"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429788
    m_Localized: "L\xF4i B\u1EA1o"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429789
    m_Localized: "Cu\u1ED3ng Phong Ti\u1EC5n V\u0169"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429790
    m_Localized: "H\u1ED3i \xC2m Ti\u1EC5n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429791
    m_Localized: "H\xE0n Hoa Quang Tuy\u1EBFn"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429792
    m_Localized: "H\u01B0 Kh\xF4ng L\xF4i Gi\xE1ng"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429793
    m_Localized: "H\xE0n B\u0103ng T\xE2n Tinh Ng\u1EE5c"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429794
    m_Localized: "\u0110\u1ECBa Ng\u1EE5c V\u1EABn Th\u1EA1ch V\u0169"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429795
    m_Localized: "Th\xE2m Uy\xEAn Tr\u1ECDng L\u1EF1c S\u1EE5p \u0110\u1ED5"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985885429796
    m_Localized: "Thi\xEAn L\u0103ng L\u0103ng K\xEDnh B\xE3o"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624064
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i c\xE1c l\u01B0\u1EE1i ki\u1EBFm \u1EA3o \u1EA3nh
      t\u1EEB c\u1ED5ng kh\xF4ng gian, lao t\u1EDBi k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch v\xE0
      ch\xE9m li\xEAn t\u1EE5c, g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n \u0111\xE1nh. Sau \u0111\xF3 tung nh\xE1t
      ch\xE9m k\u1EBFt li\u1EC5u h\xECnh ch\u1EEF X, g\xE2y th\xEAm <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%
      </color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng l\xEAn c\xE1c k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch xung quanh m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu ch\xEDnh."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624065
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i th\xE1nh ki\u1EBFm r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng khu
      v\u1EF1c k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch, g\xE2y nhi\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EE3t s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp. M\u1ED7i th\xE1nh ki\u1EBFm g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng l\xEAn c\xE1c k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      trong ph\u1EA1m vi \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624066
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i th\xE1nh ki\u1EBFm r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng khu
      v\u1EF1c k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch, g\xE2y nhi\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EE3t s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp. M\u1ED7i th\xE1nh ki\u1EBFm g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng l\xEAn c\xE1c k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      trong ph\u1EA1m vi \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624067
    m_Localized: "T\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t v\xF2ng ki\u1EBFm xoay t\u1EA1i v\u1ECB tr\xED
      m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng li\xEAn t\u1EE5c l\xEAn k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch trong v\xF9ng. M\u1ED7i nh\u1ECBp g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\xE0m ch\u1EADm
      k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624068
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i ki\u1EBFm \u1EA3o \u1EA3nh r\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng
      khu v\u1EF1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, g\xE2y nhi\u1EC1u \u0111\u1EE3t s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp. M\u1ED7i \u0111\u1EE3t g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      trong ph\u1EA1m vi \u1EA3nh h\u01B0\u1EDFng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624069
    m_Localized: "Tung m\u1ED9t \u0111\xF2n ch\xE9m b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i v\xE0o m\u1EE5c
      ti\xEAu \u01B0u ti\xEAn, g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. Khi tr\xFAng \u0111\u1ECBch, t\u1EA1o v\xF9ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      nh\u1ECF xung quanh m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, g\xE2y th\xEAm s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      l\xEAn c\xE1c k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch l\xE2n c\u1EADn."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624070
    m_Localized: "T\u1EA1o v\xF9ng l\u01B0\u1EE1i \u0111ao xoay quanh m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu,
      li\xEAn t\u1EE5c g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      trong ph\u1EA1m vi. M\u1ED7i hit g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t
      th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624071
    m_Localized: "T\u1EA1o v\xF9ng ch\xE9m li\xEAn t\u1EE5c quanh b\u1EA3n th\xE2n,
      g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EA7n l\xEAn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3
      k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch xung quanh. M\u1ED7i hit g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624072
    m_Localized: "G\u1EAFn \u1EA5n k\xFD l\xEAn m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, sau \u0111\xF3
      ph\xE1t n\u1ED5 g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. M\u1EE5c ti\xEAu ch\xEDnh nh\u1EADn to\xE0n b\u1ED9 s\xE1t
      th\u01B0\u01A1ng, k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch xung quanh nh\u1EADn m\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n
      s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624073
    m_Localized: "T\u1EA1o v\xF9ng s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\u1EDBn t\u1EA1i khu
      v\u1EF1c \u0111\xF4ng k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch nh\u1EA5t, li\xEAn t\u1EE5c g\xE2y
      s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng l\xEAn t\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch trong
      v\xF9ng. M\u1ED7i tick g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624074
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i m\u1ED9t c\u01A1n b\xE3o l\u1EEDa trong khu
      v\u1EF1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, li\xEAn t\u1EE5c gi\xE1ng s\xE9t xu\u1ED1ng k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch trong ph\u1EA1m vi. M\u1ED7i tia s\xE9t g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624075
    m_Localized: "M\u1ED7i khi k\xEDch ho\u1EA1t k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng, nh\u1EADn 1 stack
      M\u0169i T\xEAn S\xE9t. Khi \u0111\u1EA1t \u0111\u1EE7 stack, c\xE1c m\u0169i
      t\xEAn t\u1EF1 \u0111\u1ED9ng b\u1EAFn v\xE0o k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch g\u1EA7n
      nh\u1EA5t, m\u1ED7i m\u0169i t\xEAn g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK
      s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624076
    m_Localized: "B\u1EAFn nhi\u1EC1u m\u0169i t\xEAn \u0111i\u1EC7n v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch b\u1EB1ng nhi\u1EC1u
      ki\u1EC3u b\u1EAFn kh\xE1c nhau. M\u1ED7i m\u0169i t\xEAn g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Burn g\xE2y
      th\xEAm <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK/MATK m\u1ED7i <color=#C58CFF>{2} </color>
      gi\xE2y trong <color=#94FF40>{3} </color> l\u1EA7n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624077
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i Ph\u01B0\u1EE3ng Ho\xE0ng l\u1EEDa bay th\u1EB3ng
      v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, li\xEAn t\u1EE5c t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch tr\xEAn \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng bay. M\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n t\u1EA5n
      c\xF4ng g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985889624078
    m_Localized: "B\u1EAFn li\xEAn ti\u1EBFp nhi\u1EC1u m\u0169i t\xEAn v\u1EC1 ph\xEDa
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, m\u1ED7i m\u0169i t\xEAn g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng v\xE0 c\xF3 th\u1EC3 xuy\xEAn
      qua nhi\u1EC1u k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818368
    m_Localized: "B\u1EAFn m\u1ED9t m\u0169i t\xEAn b\u0103ng v\xE0o k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch,
      sau \u0111\xF3 lan sang c\xE1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu g\u1EA7n \u0111\xF3. M\u0169i
      t\xEAn g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng v\xE0 s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng gi\u1EA3m d\u1EA7n sau m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n
      lan."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818369
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i R\u1ED3ng S\u1EA5m t\u1EA1o v\xF9ng xo\xE1y
      \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EA5n c\xF4ng k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch xung quanh, m\u1ED7i
      l\u1EA7n g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9
      n\u0103ng. K\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch c\xF2n th\u1EA5p HP c\xF3 th\u1EC3 b\u1ECB
      ti\xEAu di\u1EC7t ngay l\u1EADp t\u1EE9c."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818370
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i ma tr\u1EADn l\xF4i \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i
      khu v\u1EF1c m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu, li\xEAn t\u1EE5c gi\xE1ng s\xE9t xu\u1ED1ng
      k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch trong v\xF9ng. M\u1ED7i tia s\xE9t g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. Sau hit cu\u1ED1i, t\u1EA1o
      v\u1EE5 n\u1ED5 \u0111i\u1EC7n v\xE0 g\xE2y Electrified l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      tr\xFAng chi\xEAu. Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Burn g\xE2y th\xEAm <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%
      </color> ATK/MATK m\u1ED7i <color=#C58CFF>{2} </color> gi\xE2y trong <color=#94FF40>{3}
      </color> l\u1EA7n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818371
    m_Localized: "T\u1EA1o v\xF2ng b\u0103ng d\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch,
      sau \u0111\xF3 tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i c\xE1c c\u1ED9t b\u0103ng b\xF9ng n\u1ED5
      trong ph\u1EA1m vi, g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng v\xE0 l\xE0m ch\u1EADm k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch tr\xFAng chi\xEAu.
      N\u1EBFu m\u1EE5c ti\xEAu \u0111ang b\u1ECB Burn ho\u1EB7c Electrified, g\xE2y
      th\xEAm <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818372
    m_Localized: "M\u1EDF c\xE1c c\u1ED5ng dung nham tr\xEAn kh\xF4ng, tri\u1EC7u
      h\u1ED3i thi\xEAn th\u1EA1ch r\u01A1i li\xEAn t\u1EE5c xu\u1ED1ng chi\u1EBFn
      tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. M\u1ED7i thi\xEAn th\u1EA1ch g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng l\xEAn k\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch
      trong v\xF9ng n\u1ED5. Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng Burn g\xE2y th\xEAm <color=#FF8A3D>{1}%
      </color> ATK/MATK m\u1ED7i <color=#C58CFF>{2} </color> gi\xE2y trong <color=#94FF40>{3}
      </color> l\u1EA7n."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818373
    m_Localized: "T\u1EA1o m\u1ED9t h\u1ED1 \u0111en h\u01B0 kh\xF4ng h\xFAt k\u1EBB
      \u0111\u1ECBch v\xE0o trung t\xE2m v\xE0 g\xE2y s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng li\xEAn
      t\u1EE5c. M\u1ED7i \u0111\u1EE3t g\xE2y <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color> ATK s\xE1t
      th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. Khi k\u1EBFt th\xFAc, h\u1ED1 \u0111en
      ph\xE1t n\u1ED5, g\xE2y th\xEAm <color=#FF8A3D>{1}% </color> ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng di\u1EC7n r\u1ED9ng."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6527985893818374
    m_Localized: "Tri\u1EC7u h\u1ED3i c\xE1c tinh th\u1EC3 ma ph\xE1p xoay quanh
      b\u1EA3n th\xE2n, li\xEAn t\u1EE5c b\u1EAFn laser qu\xE9t chi\u1EBFn tr\u01B0\u1EDDng.
      K\u1EBB \u0111\u1ECBch ch\u1EA1m tia laser nh\u1EADn <color=#FF8A3D>{0}%</color>
      ATK s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng k\u1EF9 n\u0103ng. Trong th\u1EDDi gian thi tri\u1EC3n,
      b\u1EA3n th\xE2n \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c gi\u1EA3m s\xE1t th\u01B0\u01A1ng nh\u1EADn
      v\xE0o."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6834115274653696
    m_Localized: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng Sinh L\u1EF1c"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
